 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vsLXmocky5kQ7kNvwGKPIzD&_nc_oc=Adq1GXLcTDz7jM5hCXV5ONG4KLHl_nLW1O3o_bw9CfSCZ3_MopGKYKfnUCNCjcmQI50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGOuo1pm6aSWakCbbE8FV13pqZhAy94t0w9r_dcOL-Cdw&oe=6A707901"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HNUrcPwxgVUQ7kNvwGDiXlI&_nc_oc=AdppgrW_RonQU6rAWxGeWXnCQmuU07tjupADKQyqCVi5zsujac9c1u7txMHaMsNVd04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGf2zEi-2lyGySN5GzBZrz2xwQUtY6DPUTk_2nJUc-qqQ&oe=6A708666"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HGlnyqstf2kQ7kNvwGjHXHU&_nc_oc=AdrU4KYAgWacQzAeUWaXP7Qzj19A7xWWNqLsx4VkvgJV5wRrcFUqb3T6ANtE-sL6uTE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHM_2ja35Ak7HwXuofQV9i29QfnlY1BD9OAN2xNfhdVbw&oe=6A70905C"}, {"fil